# Class: obo:DOID_0050159 (lymphoid interstitial pneumonia)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:type obo:ECO_0007645) Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "url:https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/11790668") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:DOID_0050159 "An idiopathic interstitial pneumonia which involves diffuse interstitial infiltration of involved areas mostly with T lymphocytes, plasma cells, and macrophages. Lymphoid hyperplasia is frequently seen. Onset is often slow with gradually increasing cough and breathlessness over 3 or more years. Fever, weight loss, chest pain, and arthralgia are occasionally found. Crackles may be detected as the disease progresses.")
