# Class: obo:DOID_0080982 (X-linked intellectual disability-hypotonic facies syndrome-1)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "url:https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15508018/") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:DOID_0080982 "A syndromic X-linked intellectual disability that is characterized primarily by severely impaired intellectual development, dysmorphic facies, and a highly skewed X-inactivation pattern in carrier women and that has_material_basis_in mutation in the ATRX gene on chromosome Xq13. This now comprises several syndromes previously reported separately, including Carpenter-Waziri syndrome, Holmes-Gang syndrome, and Smith-Fineman-Myers syndrome.")
