AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "url:https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30770808/") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:DOID_0081344 "A congenital myopathy that is neonatal hypotonia followed by mildly delayed walking in childhood, mainly affecting proximal muscles, and that has_material_basis_in homozygous mutation in the FXR1 gene on chromosome 3q28. Biallelic mutation in the FXR1 gene also causes CMYP9A.")
