# Class: obo:DOID_13274 (obsolete enzootic pneumonia of calves)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "url:http://merckvetmanual.com/mvm/index.jsp?cfile=htm/bc/121207.htm") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:DOID_13274 "A bovine respiratory disease complex which is an infectious disease in calves involving stress and possibly an initial respiratory viral infection followed by a secondary bacterial infection of the lower respiratory tract. Mycoplasmal and bacterial agents including Pasteurella multocida, Mannheimia haemolytica, and Mycoplasma bovis represent the most frequently isolated pathogenic organisms.")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:DOID_13274 "Enzootic pneumonia of calves (disorder)")
